 "differences": [
  "The SD of initial reach direction (Experiment 3) is 11 deg without outlier removal and about 4.5 deg after removing, per participant and target, trials more than 5 robust SDs (1.4826 x MAD) from the median; the paper says it rejected outlier points but not by which rule, so the published 4.8 and 4.4 deg are reproduced only with such a rule (a tolerance of 1 deg is used). Mean movement-onset SD and the number of excluded trials per participant are recomputed by us from the unfiltered paths with the paper's rules, and may differ slightly from the published values (see the checks)."
 ],
